          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "acceptance",
          "description": "The report gives the exact test commands with pass, fail, and skip counts, marks success criteria 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, and 7 as met or unmet with evidence, and lists by id any record left on the board after cleanup. Black Agent re-runs Yellow Agent's test command to verify it."
        },
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "outcome",
          "description": "50 new tests; all 52 operation constants valid against the live schema; all six suites pass; the live round trip passed every step and left nothing on the board."
        }
